{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John! Long time no talk! Guess what - I got a puppy two weeks ago! Her name's Coco and she's adorable."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-d6c77a5c57ea9cc2894ed430", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.672015+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d6c77a5c57ea9cc2894ed430", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d6c77a5c57ea9cc2894ed430", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria! Coco looks so adorable! She seems so happy in that photo. How's it been having her around?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-2e5bc3c933e602eedf8f0fe4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.698449+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2e5bc3c933e602eedf8f0fe4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2e5bc3c933e602eedf8f0fe4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! It really brings joy to my life; she's always there to greet me when I come home. It's definitely been an adjustment taking care of her, but it's totally worth it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-53106ed488ce260415e33e93", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.717817+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "53106ed488ce260415e33e93", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "53106ed488ce260415e33e93", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That's great! Pets are the best for lifting our spirits. I'm always still thinking about Max- here's a pic of him."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-658a315cc8aa0d8913c13cd7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.753820+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "658a315cc8aa0d8913c13cd7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "658a315cc8aa0d8913c13cd7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Aww, he looks so cute in that pic! He obviously brought you lots of joy. What's your best memory with him?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-07fcb9100c913e84ce11004e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.780891+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "07fcb9100c913e84ce11004e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "07fcb9100c913e84ce11004e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! Max and I had a blast on our camping trip last summer. We hiked, swam, and made great memories. It was a really peaceful and awesome experience."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-562ef35d092c74b4b1f167f2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.802538+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "562ef35d092c74b4b1f167f2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "562ef35d092c74b4b1f167f2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John, sounds like you and Max had a great time! Camping with pets can be so soul-nourishing, right?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-0d03f9535dc44b51c08a7ca0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.819948+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0d03f9535dc44b51c08a7ca0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0d03f9535dc44b51c08a7ca0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Definitely, Maria! It was so chill. Being out in nature, away from all the noise and taking some quality time was great. It was a nice break from the everyday hustle and bustle."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-bed14145b007aced366dc71e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.850304+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bed14145b007aced366dc71e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bed14145b007aced366dc71e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! Sounds awesome! I can imagine that it felt good to tune out and get lost in nature!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-b206b4825b3537e41267262c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.871262+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b206b4825b3537e41267262c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b206b4825b3537e41267262c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, it was like restarting my mind and spirit. It's amazing how peaceful and pretty it can be. It made me remember the little things in life and savor the peaceful moments."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-b45792e230a4b56e00e761b1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.890597+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b45792e230a4b56e00e761b1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b45792e230a4b56e00e761b1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, nature is amazing like that. It's like a reset for our souls and your photos capture it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-06c9f6b97a90a6f49cf53fef", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.911745+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "06c9f6b97a90a6f49cf53fef", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "06c9f6b97a90a6f49cf53fef", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! I'm glad my photos can capture that feeling. They help me take a step back and appreciate the little things in life - especially these days. There've been some tough times lately for me."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-50bcb0bb5cfcee4135ea97d4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.935254+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "50bcb0bb5cfcee4135ea97d4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "50bcb0bb5cfcee4135ea97d4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sorry to hear that, John. Is there anything on your mind lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-c5492597e209e9c57c6a830d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.960250+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c5492597e209e9c57c6a830d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c5492597e209e9c57c6a830d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Lately, I've been stumped about something. Don't feel like I'm making much of an impact here, which has me questioning my decisions and goals."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-95f83e042a2e73e855e2f89f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.977693+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "95f83e042a2e73e855e2f89f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "95f83e042a2e73e855e2f89f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, I understand how you feel. It's tough when you start questioning that. But remember, even small things can make a difference. Why do you feel that way?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-9c74168e92dd82cc9d133238", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:22.995208+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9c74168e92dd82cc9d133238", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9c74168e92dd82cc9d133238", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks for understanding. I just want to positively affect people and the world, but it feels like I'm stuck. I need to find a better way to focus my passion and enthusiasm."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-ac86d6abefd32e56a3afa360", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:23.014139+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ac86d6abefd32e56a3afa360", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ac86d6abefd32e56a3afa360", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, it can be tough. Taking small steps can help. Have you thought about any ideas for how to channel your energy into something meaningful?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-d83059e9641fe659cae98ee6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:23.034556+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d83059e9641fe659cae98ee6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d83059e9641fe659cae98ee6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Lately I've been exploring options. One idea I had was to join local organizations or volunteering programs. Maybe that's an option."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-9a1dc3eecf5ea1ac0b04f5fb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:23.049950+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9a1dc3eecf5ea1ac0b04f5fb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9a1dc3eecf5ea1ac0b04f5fb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sounds like a great plan, John! That could definitely help you make a difference. You can meet like-minded people and contribute to causes that you care about. Why not do some research and explore the organizations you'd be interested in?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-4ac838820b9ab5b4123ef56b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:23.066564+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4ac838820b9ab5b4123ef56b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4ac838820b9ab5b4123ef56b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, Maria, that's a good idea. I'll make a list of the ones that suit what I believe in and reach out for more info. Thanks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-2960f7ba59c9c6eca93ebb15", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:23.082697+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2960f7ba59c9c6eca93ebb15", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2960f7ba59c9c6eca93ebb15", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: No worries, John. I'm happy to help. Let me know if you need anything else. Keep going, you can do it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-b77cc307913a2f638d1e561f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:23.101566+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b77cc307913a2f638d1e561f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b77cc307913a2f638d1e561f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks for your kind words, Maria! I'll let you know if I need anything else. Keep being positive and kind, you're an inspiration!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-342517411339d69b6dcacbe3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:23.121028+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "342517411339d69b6dcacbe3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "342517411339d69b6dcacbe3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John. Your words mean a lot. I'll definitely keep spreading positivity. Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_30-d5df13bd9f7593231a9bc28e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:35:23.140335+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d5df13bd9f7593231a9bc28e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d5df13bd9f7593231a9bc28e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
